WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Loops opens the loop library: LYNX's own sounds and beats, and the loops in your folders.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Search, or pick an instrument or a genre.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:18.600
Click a loop to hear it. LYNX reads its length, tempo and key.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.400
Drag it onto the timeline: it plays at the song's tempo. Set the song to its key.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:30.200
Add the chords the same way, and press Play.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:36.400
Everything plays in time with the beat.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:45.600
Change the song's key with Key: the loops follow it, keeping their length.
